# Every text file is committed as LF; autocrlf on any given shell decides
# only what lands on that shell's own disk, never what's in the blob.
# Added 2026-09-21: a repo-wide CRLF/LF diff (94 files, content-identical,
# HANDOVER.md's own 2026-09-21 entry) was invisible from one shell and real
# from another purely because of each one's own core.autocrlf setting, with
# nothing here pinning it. This line makes the committed line ending
# deterministic regardless of that setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
